  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Sakure Youth Pineapple Farm..Location: Nzara County/Town..Summary: Sakure Youth Pineapple Farm Limited seeks to provide its community with quality pineapples thereby increasing the nutritional status of their community. They plan on supplying good quality pineapples to local markets, hotels, and individuals in the surrounding area as well as meeting the nutritional demands of the community.</narrative>
